sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant BE as Backend (Express)
    participant DB as Database (Aiven MySQL via Prisma)
    participant CS as Cloud Storage (Backblaze B2)

    User->>FE: Click "View CV" or "Download CV" on a candidate
    FE->>BE: GET /api/candidates/:id/cv
    BE->>DB: findUnique Candidate by id, read cvUrl
    alt candidate has no CV on file
        BE-->>FE: 404 "No CV available for this candidate"
    else cvUrl present
        BE->>CS: Fetch object by key (cvUrl, may include rejected/ prefix)
        alt object not found in storage
            BE-->>FE: 404 "CV file could not be found"
        else found
            CS-->>BE: File bytes
            BE->>BE: Derive display filename -- strip any folder prefix (e.g. rejected/)
            BE-->>FE: 200 stream with Content-Disposition header set to inline, filename original-name.pdf
            FE-->>User: Render PDF inline / trigger download
        end
    end
